{"title":"나의 가장 귀여운 부분","artist":"FRUITS ZIPPER","sourceId":"reference:zh03lbGfc6d2nHLdPpdF","sourceHash":"f5d77ddd6e61eb666a2ccdaa1a1522d278d8b3042bd6eb746614fb43add26d4d","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":36534232,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":20.62,"end":22.63,"text":"あれ気付いちゃいましたか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":22.63,"end":25.94,"text":"うまれて30秒 で最初に聞いた言葉は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":25.94,"end":28.24,"text":"当たり前にそりゃ覚えてないけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":28.24,"end":29.91,"text":"嬉しかったはず","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":29.91,"end":31.46,"text":"今でもだいたいのことは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":31.46,"end":33.38,"text":"かわってないっていうかそりゃ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":33.38,"end":37.36,"text":"中身は変わっていますので、その辺でも評価！（おねがい！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":37.36,"end":40.79,"text":"携帯のアンテナを光らせて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":40.79,"end":44.87,"text":"それが超キュートなあの頃だって知ってたり。","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":44.87,"end":47.75,"text":"っていうかアンテナって何っていってるような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":47.75,"end":48.48,"text":"わたしに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":48.48,"end":49.84,"text":"付き合ってくれるの好き","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":49.84,"end":52.62,"text":"逆にでもわたしのどこが好き？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":52.62,"end":53.82,"text":"ねえ？ねえ？ねえ？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":53.82,"end":56.38,"text":"わたしの一番、かわいいところに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":56.38,"end":57.47,"text":"気付いてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":57.47,"end":61.54,"text":"そんな君が一番すごいすごいよすごすぎる！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":61.54,"end":65.16,"text":"そして君が知ってるわたしが一番かわいいの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":65.16,"end":68.45,"text":"わたしもそれに気付いた！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":68.45,"end":69.14,"text":"だから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":69.14,"end":73.0,"text":"それかわいい、あれかわいいなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":73.0,"end":76.66,"text":"誰かわいい、それかわいいなんて","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":76.66,"end":82.01,"text":"言わないで、わたし以外なんてやだ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":82.01,"end":83.86,"text":"なんてありえない？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":98.07,"end":99.33,"text":"わたし気付いちゃいました","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":99.33,"end":102.97999999999999,"text":"毎日何十秒、褒められまくったお菓子は","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":102.97999999999999,"end":104.91,"text":"他よりちょっと甘くなるって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":104.91,"end":106.74000000000001,"text":"前聞いたような","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":106.74000000000001,"end":108.52000000000001,"text":"さすがにそれなんか変だけど","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":108.52000000000001,"end":110.41,"text":"わたしは言われたいタイプでして","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":110.41,"end":114.16,"text":"もっとわかりやすくていいんだよ、お待ちしてます（おねがい！）","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":114.16,"end":117.56,"text":"何してもどんな顔見せてても","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":117.56,"end":121.65,"text":"いつも超キュートだって確信してるのは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":121.65,"end":124.81,"text":"なんだかさ知らなかったタイプの運命の","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":124.81,"end":125.47,"text":"人なの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":125.47,"end":126.62,"text":"付き合ったりは無理ごめん","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":126.62,"end":129.7,"text":"逆にでもそれより楽しいよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":129.7,"end":130.53,"text":"ね！ね！ね！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":130.53,"end":132.92,"text":"わたしの一番、かわいいところを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":132.92,"end":134.67,"text":"よく見てる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":134.67,"end":138.39,"text":"そんな君がほんとに超ラッキーな人すぎる！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":138.39,"end":141.7,"text":"そして君が何年たってもそう思えるように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":141.7,"end":146.05,"text":"わたしはそれに気付いた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":160.51,"end":164.62,"text":"会えないときも、どんな表情してるかとか","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":164.62,"end":168.52,"text":"気持ちわるいくらい想像しちゃうから","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":168.52,"end":172.1,"text":"それかわいいあれかわいいよって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":172.1,"end":175.59,"text":"ほんとにかわいいっていって","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":175.59,"end":177.86,"text":"わたしの一番、かわいいところに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":177.86,"end":179.66,"text":"気付いてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":179.66,"end":183.24,"text":"そんな君が一番すごいすごいよすごすぎる！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":183.24,"end":186.81,"text":"そして君が知ってるわたしが一番かわいいの","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":186.81,"end":190.77,"text":"わたしもそれに気付いた！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":190.77,"end":192.91,"text":"わたしの一番、かわいいところを","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":192.91,"end":194.62,"text":"よく見てる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":194.62,"end":198.34,"text":"そんな君がほんとに超ラッキーな人すぎる！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":198.34,"end":202.04,"text":"そして君が何年たってもそう思えるように","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":202.04,"end":205.71,"text":"わたしはそれに気付いた","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":205.71,"end":207.95,"text":"わたしの一番、かわいいところに","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":2